{"title": "Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice", "pageid": 45218, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice.webp, /w/images/8/8c/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Ch'r'ai Tska'an</a> in Honour mode, which lets her use the legendary action <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_Soul\" title=\"Sacrifice Soul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/25px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/38px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/50px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacrifice Soul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/25px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_Soul\" title=\"Sacrifice Soul\">Sacrifice Soul</a> immediately after a humanoid has died.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round when a humanoid dies, the Ch'r'ai can spend a legendary action to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_Soul\" title=\"Sacrifice Soul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/25px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/38px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/50px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/25px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_Soul\" title=\"Sacrifice Soul\">Sacrifice</a> its soul to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/18px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/26px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/35px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vlaakith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/18px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\">Vlaakith</a> in return for great power. Once 3 souls have been sacrificed, the Ch'r'ai takes on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith%27s_Undying_Aspect_(Condition)\" title=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith%27s_Undying_Aspect_(Condition)\" title=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect (Condition)\">Vlaakith's Undying Aspect</a>. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>When a humanoid dies, the Ch'r'ai can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_Soul\" title=\"Sacrifice Soul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/25px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/38px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/50px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/25px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_Soul\" title=\"Sacrifice Soul\">Sacrifice</a> its soul to Vlaakith in return for great power.</li>\n<li>Once 3 souls have been sacrificed, the Ch'r'ai takes on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith%27s_Undying_Aspect_(Condition)\" title=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith%27s_Undying_Aspect_(Condition)\" title=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect (Condition)\">Vlaakith's Undying Aspect</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Tska'an</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Once per round, sacrifice a soul to Vlaakith in return for power. After 3 souls, gain <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith%27s_Undying_Aspect_(Condition)\" title=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect (Condition)\">Vlaakith's Undying Aspect</a></div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1770/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18512/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7496/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 136/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 767683/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.032      1 -total\n 99.34%   50.695      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 35.70%   18.216      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 32.06%   16.360      5 Template:Icon_link\n 31.23%   15.939      1 Template:PageSeo\n 30.73%   15.684      5 Template:Icon_text\n 25.59%   13.060     12 Template:Trim\n 23.69%   12.089      2 Template:SAI\n 16.62%    8.480      5 Template:Ifempty\n 13.46%    6.869    